This is a SENTINEL FILE, not a loctree config directory.

Never run `loct` with cwd src-tauri/. That would try to create a nested
snapshot here (and a second loctree project identity). The canonical map
is the repository root:

    cd <locally-uncensored> && loct scan
    make loc          # also asserts repo root first

If this path were a directory named .loctree/, an accidental scan would
succeed. A regular file makes mkdir fail closed instead.
